      "ordinal": 18,
      "source_sha256": "e6bd1632a120761308f966a6cafaf7e2d91d550f507bf8a5cbacce36baa25833",
      "target": "### 步骤 2：第一次 API 调用（Python）\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-04:b0036",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# APIs & Keys",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 2: First API call (Python)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 18,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-04:b0037",
      "kind": "fence",
      "heading_path": [
        "# APIs & Keys",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 2: First API call (Python)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 19,
      "source_sha256": "95834552f0c77ae6eb292cfb94ab639b564a6e1914b57058a05e520169d86ca7",
      "target": "```python\nimport os\n\nimport anthropic\n\nclient = anthropic.Anthropic()\n\nMODEL = os.environ.get(\"LLM_MODEL\", \"claude-sonnet-5\")\n\nresponse = client.messages.create(\n    model=MODEL,\n    max_tokens=256,\n    messages=[{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"What is a neural network in one sentence?\"}]\n)\n\nprint(response.content[0].text)\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-04:b0038",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# APIs & Keys",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 2: First API call (Python)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 19,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-04:b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# APIs & Keys",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 2: First API call (Python)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 20,
      "source_sha256": "afcfeb66cf1e4f091c83f572b3d3b5e383e79b8098c02448ff1348056370b629",
      "target": "`LLM_MODEL` 用于选择 Anthropic 模型 ID，默认值是不带日期的 Sonnet 别名。其他提供商（OpenAI、Google 等）也采用“密钥加模型 ID”的模式，但各自的 SDK、端点和请求/响应 schema（结构定义）不同。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-04:b0040",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# APIs & Keys",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 2: First API call (Python)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 20,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-04:b0041",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# APIs & Keys",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 3: First API call (TypeScript)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 21,
      "source_sha256": "fa86eacf076c7a602a95469230df03a0ef53472a91ee9e067742cf0e5200cf5b",
      "target": "### 步骤 3：第一次 API 调用（TypeScript）\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-04:b0042",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# APIs & Keys",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 3: First API call (TypeScript)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 21,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-04:b0043",
      "kind": "fence",
      "heading_path": [
        "# APIs & Keys",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 3: First API call (TypeScript)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 22,
      "source_sha256": "ea905db3ac84e7a00022e5d57b71406f89cd2e6ab61c9afb12c5dedcedcbe8dc",
      "target": "```typescript\nimport Anthropic from \"@anthropic-ai/sdk\";\n\nconst client = new Anthropic();\n\nconst MODEL = process.env.LLM_MODEL ?? \"claude-sonnet-5\";\n\nconst response = await client.messages.create({\n  model: MODEL,\n  max_tokens: 256,\n  messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: \"What is a neural network in one sentence?\" }],\n});\n\nconsole.log(response.content[0].text);\n```\n"
    },
